\sectiontitle{Challenges/Roadblocks }

\vspace{0.05cm}

\instruction{

}

\vspace{0.25
cm}

\answerbox{4.75cm}{
A main challenge is maintaining accurate resource
availability when hospitals update their records
and multiple users request the same limited
resource.

The proposed solution is to recheck availability
during allocation and use synchronization together
with database transactions.

Another challenge is keeping data consistent
across related tables while processing requests.
We are addressing this through relational
database design and SQL operations.

The next challenge will be connecting the existing
backend to a responsive frontend and validating
the complete request-to-confirmation workflow.

Functional and concurrent request testing will
be performed using sample data before the system
is considered complete.
}

